      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 158(i) Kanun adalah dipinda dengan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "memotong perkataan \"or in the case of trials by jury or trials with the aid of assessors before the yerdict of the jury is returned or the opinions of the assessors are expressed\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 177 Kanun adalah dipinda dengan memotong"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "perkataan \"or proceed under Chapter XVII with a view 177. to the committal of the accused for trial by the High Court, and shall record such order upon the proceedings\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_8__subsec_3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Kanun adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seksyen 177 dalam Bab XIX seksyen yang berikut: 177A. (1) A prosecution in respect of an offence \"Trans- mission which is to be tried by the High Court in of case accordance with Chapter XX, shall not be to, and trial by, instituted except by or with the consent of the the High Public Prosecutor: Court. Provided that a person may be arrested, or a warrant for his arrest may be issued and executed, and any such person may be remanded in custody notwithstanding that the consent of the Public Prosecutor to the institution of a prosecution for the offence has not been obtained, but the case shall not be further prosecuted until the consent has been obtained. (2) In any prosecution pursuant to subsection (1), the accused shall be produced before the Magistrate's Court which shall, after the charge has been explained to him, transmit the case to the High Court and cause the accused to appear or be brought before such Court as soon as may be practicable: Provided that when the accused is brought before the Magistrate's Court before the Public Prosecutor has consented to the prosecution, the charge shall be explained to him but he shall not be called upon to plead thereto."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_8__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "When the accused appears or is brought before the High Court in accordance with subsection (2), the High Court shall fix a date for his trial which shall be held in accordance with the procedure under Chapter XX.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~chp_XVII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Tajuk kepada Bab XX Kanun adalah dipinda dengan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "memotong perkataan \"WITHOUT ASSESSORS\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/41/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Kanun Prosedur Jenayah (Pindaan) 1994."
      }
    },
